{"ID":"20240506082111-kb4dxae","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082111-kb4dxae","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082111-kb4dxae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506093622-6on9rtd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612105414-43zueje\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626155316-jmsvp03\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:12\u0026#125;","title":"221合欢（合欢皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821140736"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240506093622-6on9rtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506093622-6on9rtd","updated":"20240506093622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合欢皮"}]},{"ID":"20240506093622-fh0kv6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506093622-fh0kv6s","updated":"20240821140434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢皮-20240205164454-fwkvo8z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626154358-6xbt1ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626154358-6xbt1ox","updated":"20240821140439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626154358-775if74.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 306px;","style":"width: 296px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢2-20240626154510-6u9e9my.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 296px;\" parent-style=\"width: 306px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240626154821-tjg2rab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626154821-tjg2rab","updated":"20240821140443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢-20240626154821-xxyuywe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 951px;","style":"width: 941px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢1-20240626154701-2gvfax1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 941px;\" parent-style=\"width: 951px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626155206-o3fak8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626155206-o3fak8c","updated":"20240821140852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 666px;","style":"width: 656px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢6-20240626155206-t6v1pob.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 656px;\" parent-style=\"width: 666px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 564px;","style":"width: 554px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 4-20240821140852-33li5kb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 554px;\" parent-style=\"width: 564px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140711-57gl5mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140711-57gl5mr","updated":"20240821140736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 929px;","style":"width: 919px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 2-20240821140710-kg11q08.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 919px;\" parent-style=\"width: 929px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 3-20240821140736-brxqp7z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140618-4ddzjif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140618-4ddzjif","updated":"20240821140638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢-20240821140618-np4526p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 1-20240821140638-yqd987a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626155018-i2oeiw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626155018-i2oeiw4","updated":"20240821140447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 984px;","style":"width: 974px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢4-20240626155018-bng4hci.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 974px;\" parent-style=\"width: 984px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626155316-jmsvp03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626155316-jmsvp03","updated":"20240626155325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：合欢为合欢树的树皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105420-f1q3amj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105420-f1q3amj"}},{"ID":"20240612105438-x9lwg4y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-x9lwg4y","updated":"20240612105443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105438-6yc5v4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-6yc5v4b","updated":"20240612105438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105438-osl3v2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-osl3v2n","updated":"20240612105438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主安五脏，利心志，（艺文类聚作和心志，《御览》作和心气。）令人献乐无忧。久服轻身明目得所欲。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105438-6qrjq2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-6qrjq2d","updated":"20240612105438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生益州。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105438-ita4usu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-ita4usu","updated":"20240612105438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《唐本》注云：或曰合昏，欢昏音相近。日华子云：夜合。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105438-by0g15z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105438-by0g15z","updated":"20240612105438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上木，中品一十七种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105459-eqfazpx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105459-eqfazpx"}},{"ID":"20240612105500-59nycem","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105500-59nycem","updated":"20240612105507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105500-gkwf5w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105500-gkwf5w6","updated":"20240612105500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花，上半白，下半肉红，散垂如丝，树似梧桐，枝柔叶繁，互相交结，每一风来，辄似解了不相牵缀，树之阶庭，使人不忿。其叶至夜而合，故又谓之夜合花。味平，无毒。主安五脏，利心志，耐风寒，令人欢乐无忧，久服轻身明目。丹溪云∶合欢属土，而有水与金，补阴之有捷功也。兼治磕损疼痛。皮主肺痈唾脓，心胸甲错，又能杀虫，续筋骨。煎膏消痈肿，叶汁可洗衣垢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105523-ftz2d29","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105523-ftz2d29"}},{"ID":"20240612105524-176qlf2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-176qlf2","updated":"20240612105527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-9urhy6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-9urhy6l","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-861hfcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-861hfcl","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】甘平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-6liysn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-6liysn2","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主安五脏，和心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身，明目，得所欲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-hkwylq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-hkwylq4","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶生豫州山谷，及益州、汴洛，所在山谷亦有。植之庭除，令人不忿。嵇康《养生论》云∶合欢蠲忿，萱草忘忧。古今注云∶欲蠲人忿，赠以青裳。青裳，合欢也，越人谓之乌赖树，金光明经谓之尸利洒树，俗谓之萌葛树也。干似梧桐，枝甚柔弱。叶如皂角，细而繁密，互相交结，每一风来，辄自相解，了不相牵。五月发花红白，上有丝茸。秋实作荚，子极纤薄。收采皮叶，不拘时月。修治其皮，削去粗皮，缓火焙炒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-w10vqa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-w10vqa5","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先人云∶阳动而开，阴静而合，此至和，此至安也。动而能静，开而必合，此方至和，此方至安也。若动不能开，静不能合，与动不能静，开不能合，斯不和，斯不安矣。合欢昼而阳舒，夜而阴合，静时交结，动不相牵，开合动静，咸得所欲，是得阴阳之正，既安且和，人"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-0zsfib1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-0zsfib1","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶昼开夜合，以昼夜为呼吸者也。当安心肺之阳，肾肝之阴，并安中州，滋培后天者欤。和心志欢乐无忧者，以脏安则神安，神安则志溢，志溢则无恐惧忧悲矣。俨似卫气之出入，亦可安卫气之昼出于阳，夜入于阴。更安营气之周行经隧，镇定中州故也。息同天地，故久服轻身明目，皆得所欲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-hwsaa6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-hwsaa6b","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（呼出心与肺，吸入肾与肝。呼吸之间，脾受谷味，其脉在中。脾者，中州也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612105524-u3bovgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105524-u3bovgp","updated":"20240612105524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（惟脏安心和，故欢乐无忧。惟欢乐无忧，久之自身轻目明，而欲得矣。盖气郁闷则重滞，乐则飞扬而轻也。肝屈抑则目昏，乐则开爽而明也。心愁虑，则不能如意，乐则从心所欲，无弗得也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612105533-juu3671","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105533-juu3671"}},{"ID":"20240612105534-1hbrhws","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105534-1hbrhws","updated":"20240612105538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105534-99b6pyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105534-99b6pyl","updated":"20240612105534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀土气以生，故味甘，气平，无毒。入手少阴、足太阴经。心为君主之官，木自调和土，为万物之母；主养五脏，脾虚则五脏不安。心气燥急，则遇事拂郁多忧。甘主益脾，脾实则五脏自安，甘可以缓心气，舒缓则神明自畅而欢乐。无忧觉照圆通所欲咸遂，阴既强而目亦明矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105534-xqv5itq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105534-xqv5itq","updated":"20240612105534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢，又名交枝树。采皮及叶，利心志，补阴安五脏，明目，令人事事如欲，时常安乐无忧。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105658-tvfaxyz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105658-tvfaxyz"}},{"ID":"20240612105659-xhsqk5t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105659-xhsqk5t","updated":"20240612105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢皮《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105659-q8gfyl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105659-q8gfyl2","updated":"20240612105659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名夜合．和调心脾．"}]},{"ID":"20240612105659-am9g5p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105659-am9g5p2","updated":"20240612105659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平．安五脏．和心志．令人欢乐无忧．（心为君主之官、土为万物之母、二脏调和、则五脏自安、神明自畅、养生论云∶合欢蠲忿、正谓此也．）和血止痛．明目消肿．续筋骨．长肌肉．（丹溪曰∶补阴之功甚捷、与白蜡同入膏用、神效．而外科未用、何也．）涂蜘蛛咬．（生油调．）杀虫．不拘入煎为末．熬膏外治．并妙．得酒良．"}]},{"ID":"20240612105643-hskspsg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105643-hskspsg"}},{"ID":"20240612105646-u3jpvsa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105646-u3jpvsa","updated":"20240612105650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢皮《雷公炮制药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105646-u07q94g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105646-u07q94g","updated":"20240612105646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，性平无毒，入心经。主安五脏，利心志，杀诸虫，消痈肿，续筋骨，令人欢乐无怒，轻身明目，花主小儿撮口，煎汤洗拭，跌打伤疼，热酒调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105646-kpsr98y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105646-kpsr98y","updated":"20240612105646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶合欢味甘，何以独入心家？经所谓以甘泻之之说也。心得所胜，而痈疮诸患为之自释矣！其叶细细相并，至夜则合，又名夜合花，似绒拂可爱，俗又谓之乌绒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105634-a95t322","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105634-a95t322"}},{"ID":"20240612105635-dh8d05v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105635-dh8d05v","updated":"20240612105639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢花《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105635-ji911q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105635-ji911q5","updated":"20240612105635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其色如今之醮晕线，上半白，下半肉红，散垂如丝，为花之异。其绿叶至夜则合，又谓之夜合花。陈藏器、日华子皆曰皮杀虫，又曰续筋骨。经中不言。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105624-yztxvj4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105624-yztxvj4"}},{"ID":"20240612105625-j26pehw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105625-j26pehw","updated":"20240612105629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105625-5tsgyxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105625-5tsgyxw","updated":"20240612105625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。安五脏消痈肿。续筋骨。折伤疼痛合欢散。合欢皮（炒黑）四两。芥菜子（炒）一两。研末每服二钱。温酒临睡服。滓敷患处。治扑损折骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105614-dkakye6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105614-dkakye6"}},{"ID":"20240612105616-qeoqtcf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-qeoqtcf","updated":"20240612105620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105616-82qqwbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-82qqwbz","updated":"20240612105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（一名夜合．俗间少识．当以其非疗病之功也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612105616-el546nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-el546nw","updated":"20240612105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【木皮】【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240612105616-2lsg72c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-2lsg72c","updated":"20240612105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612105616-piyfgwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-piyfgwd","updated":"20240612105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240612105616-mwxa1bu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105616-mwxa1bu","updated":"20240612105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"安五脏．和心志．令人欢乐无忧．久服轻身明目．煎膏消痈肿．续筋骨．杀虫．捣末和铛下墨．生油调涂蜘蛛咬疮．用叶洗衣垢．折伤疼痛．研末酒服二钱匕．和血消肿止痛．合欢属土．补阴之功甚捷．长肌肉．续筋骨．概可见矣．与白蜡同入膏用神效．而外科家未曾录用何也．"}]},{"ID":"20240612105605-33mbocy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105605-33mbocy"}},{"ID":"20240612105606-aiddqyb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105606-aiddqyb","updated":"20240612105610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105606-tgjmn97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105606-tgjmn97","updated":"20240612105606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主安五脏，利心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身，明目得所欲，生益州山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105553-l24q8zv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105553-l24q8zv"}},{"ID":"20240612105554-9hjsdmh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105554-9hjsdmh","updated":"20240612105601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105554-51mr5n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105554-51mr5n7","updated":"20240612105557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"合欢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，夜合也。生益州山谷，今近京雍洛间皆有之，人家多植于庭除间。木似梧桐，枝甚柔弱；叶似皂荚槐等，极细而繁密，互相交结，每一风来，辄似相解了，不相牵缀；其叶至暮而合，故一名合昏；五月花发，红白色，瓣上若丝茸；然至秋而实作荚，子极薄细。采皮及叶用，不拘时月。崔豹《古今注》曰∶欲蠲人之忧，则赠以丹棘，丹棘一名忘忧。欲蠲人之忿，则赠以青裳，青裳，合欢也。故嵇康种之舍前是也。韦宙《独行方》∶胸心甲错，是为肺痈，黄昏汤主之。取夜合皮掌大一枚，水三升，煮取半分，再服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105543-js9u8zg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105543-js9u8zg"}},{"ID":"20240612105544-rcwm15e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105544-rcwm15e","updated":"20240612105549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105544-o5gcgd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105544-o5gcgd0","updated":"20240612105544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（乔木）补脾阴缓心气"}]},{"ID":"20240612105544-izc9055","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105544-izc9055","updated":"20240612105544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢（专入脾。兼入心）。因何命名。谓其服之脏腑安养。令人欢欣怡悦。故以欢名。第此味甘气平。服之虽能入脾补阴。（朱震亨曰。合欢属土。补阴之功。长肌肉。续筋骨。概可见矣。）入心缓气。而令五脏安和。神气自畅。及单用煎汤而治肺痈唾浊。（韦宙独行方）合阿胶煎汤而治肺痿吐血。皆验。与白蜡熬膏。而为长肉生肌续筋接骨之药。然气缓力微。用之非止钱许可以奏效。故必重用久服。方有补益怡悦心志之效矣。若使急病而求治即欢悦。其能之乎？合欢即合昏木。植于庭除。干似梧桐。枝甚柔弱。叶似皂角。极细繁密。叶则夜合者是。去粗皮。炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105512-1mxo1i5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105512-1mxo1i5"}},{"ID":"20240612105513-vjx2yxl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-vjx2yxl","updated":"20240612105517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-4quhdhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-4quhdhv","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」合昏、夜合、青裳、萌葛、乌赖树。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-gtfwzf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-gtfwzf0","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（木皮）甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-b4qz289","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-b4qz289","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-36v1cmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-36v1cmo","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、肺痈。取合欢皮一掌大，加水三升，煮成一半，分二次服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-3p3lh3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-3p3lh3a","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、跌打损伤。用合欢皮，把粗皮去掉，炒成黑色，取四两，与芥菜子（炒）一两，共研为末，每服二钱，卧时服，温酒送下，另以药末敷伤处，能助接骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-ozkejiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-ozkejiw","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿撮口风。有合欢花枝煮成浓汁，揩洗口腔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105513-szh63gd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105513-szh63gd","updated":"20240612105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、中风挛缩。用合欢枝、柏枝、槐枝、桑枝、石榴枝各五两，生锉；另取糯米五升、黑豆五升、羌活二两，防风五钱、细曲七升半。先以水五斗煎五枝，取汗二斗五升浸米、豆蒸熟，加曲与防风、羌活，照常法酿。封二十日后，压汁饮服，每饮五合，常有酒气即可，不宜过醉致吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105444-w1h4zbc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105444-w1h4zbc"}},{"ID":"20240612105450-gkgzpoq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105450-gkgzpoq","updated":"20240612105454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105450-zt4xh1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105450-zt4xh1e","updated":"20240612105450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平，无毒。主安五脏，和心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身，明目，得所欲。生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105450-mj7ylym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105450-mj7ylym","updated":"20240612105450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稽公《养生论》亦云∶合欢蠲忿，萱草忘忧。诗人又有萱草，皆云即是今鹿葱，而不入药用。至于合欢，举俗无识之者。当以其非疗病之功，稍见轻略，遂致永谢。犹如长生之法，人洛阳华林苑中，犹云合欢如丁林，唯不来江左耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105450-s2wkzxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105450-s2wkzxo","updated":"20240612105450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此树，生叶似皂荚槐等，极细，五月花发，红白色，所在山涧中有之。今东西京第宅山池间亦有种者，名曰合欢，或曰合昏。秋实作荚，子极薄细。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105420-ytqcvwe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105420-ytqcvwe"}},{"ID":"20240612105425-7kntigx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-7kntigx","updated":"20240612105433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-zxgkjbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-zxgkjbl","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、平，无毒。主安五脏，利心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身明目，得所欲。生益州山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-k7iiv5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-k7iiv5o","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶按嵇康《养生论》云∶合欢蠲忿，萱草忘忧也。诗人又有萱草，皆即今鹿葱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-p4nppz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-p4nppz7","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不入药用。至于合欢，俗间少识之者，当以其非疗病之功。稍见轻略，遂致永谢，犹如长生之法，人罕敦尚，亦为遗弃。唐本注云∶此树生叶似皂荚、槐等，极细。五月花发，红白色。所在山涧中有之，今东、西京第宅山池间亦有种者，名曰合欢，或曰合昏。秋实作荚，子极薄细尔。今按陈藏器本草云∶合欢皮杀虫，捣为末，和铛下墨，生油调涂蜘蛛咬疮。及叶并去垢，叶至暮即合，故云合昏也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本音义云∶树似梧桐，枝弱叶繁，互相交结。每一风来，辄似相解了，不相牵缀。树之阶庭，使人不忿。日华子云∶夜合皮，杀虫，煎膏消痈肿，并续筋骨。叶可洗衣垢，又名合欢树。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-39l8obf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-39l8obf","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶合欢，夜合也。生益州山谷，今近京雍、洛间皆有之，人家多植于庭除间。木似梧桐，枝甚柔弱。叶似皂荚、槐等，极细而繁密，互相交结。每一风来，辄似相解了，不相牵缀。其叶至暮而合，故一名合昏。五月花发，红白色，瓣上若丝茸，然至秋而实作荚，子极薄细。采皮及叶用，不枸时月。崔豹《古今注》曰∶欲蠲人之忧，则赠以丹棘。丹棘一名忘忧。欲蠲人之忿，则赠以青裳。青裳，合欢也。故嵇康种之舍前是也。韦宙《独行方》∶胸心甲错，是为肺痈，黄昏汤治。取夜合皮掌大一枚，水三升，煮取半分，再服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-kuv645v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-kuv645v","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子母秘录∶小儿撮口病。夜合花枝浓煮汁，拭口并洗。又方∶打 损疼痛。夜合花末酒调，服二钱匕，妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105425-leqbbb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105425-leqbbb7","updated":"20240612105425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶合欢花，其色如今之醮晕线，上半白，下半肉红，散垂如丝，为花之异。其绿叶至夜则合，又谓之夜合花。陈藏器、日华子皆曰皮杀虫，又曰续筋骨。《经》中不言。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105319-3mgxm81","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105319-3mgxm81"}},{"ID":"20240612105412-nquv77g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612105412-nquv77g","updated":"20240612105417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612105412-600v4sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105412-600v4sk","updated":"20240612105412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主安五脏，和心志，令人欢乐无忧。久服轻身，明目，得所欲。生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105412-1phywug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105412-1phywug","updated":"20240612105412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嵇公《养生论》亦云∶合欢蠲忿，萱草忘忧。诗人又有萱草，皆云即是今鹿葱，而不入药用。至于合欢举世无识之者。当以其非治病之功，稍见轻略，遂致永谢。犹如长生之法，人罕敦尚，亦为遗弃也。洛阳华林苑中，犹云合欢如丁林，唯不来江左尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612105413-yqaztbw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612105413-yqaztbw"}},{"ID":"20240612105414-43zueje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612105414-43zueje"}}]}